Part 1 — Practice Challenge: Employee Table
Problem Statement

Create an Employee table with the following columns:

Column	Data Type	Constraint
emp_id	INT	PRIMARY KEY
emp_name	VARCHAR(50)	—
salary	INT	—
department	VARCHAR(30)	—
Tasks
Insert 5 records into the Employee table.
Display only the emp_name column.
Update the salary of one employee.
Delete one employee from the table.
Display all records from the table to verify the changes.
